    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Spend <strong>1 Civic Charge</strong> and open the Pactkeeper action dialog.</p><ul><li>Stabilization</li><li>Authority Boost</li><li>Enforcement</li><li>Containment</li><li>Closure</li></ul><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"pkSpendCivic\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4b8e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Spend Civic Charge</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/round (gain) &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> Free (as needed) &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">Spend 1 Civic Charge Die: roll it and pick one — Stabilization (reduce damage/panic/corruption/fallout by rolled amount) · Authority Boost (+roll to a manifestation DC, contested roll, or enforcement) · Enforcement (force a reroll vs. a Contract or Precedent — target takes worse) · Containment (catastrophic → controlled) · Closure (end an ongoing effect cleanly).</div>\n</div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
